          "text": "请大家记好这四个人\n2026年6月28日，广东揭阳揭东区新亨镇坪埔村，发生一起让人毛骨悚然、怒火中烧的虐狗事件-\n坪埔小学，四位男孩，分别是6年级二班学生钟梓烁、钟宇轩、钟思鑫、钟喜声，在大街上兴起就对一隻正在餵奶的流浪母狗和她3隻才半个月大的幼犬下手，他们先用铁丝勒住母狗脖子拖行，再拿起木棍疯狂殴打、戳刺，3隻无辜幼犬当场被活活打死，母狗为了保护孩子，死都不肯逃跑，却换来更残忍的折磨，最后，这些孩子竟淋上汽油，当场点火并持续殴打，母狗在烈焰中痛苦挣扎，全身烧焦而死。\n\n而他们一边笑一边拍影片，还上传网路炫耀…\n\n⚠️警告：影片含有殘忍虐待動物畫面，可能令人不適，請慎入。\n\n#揭阳虐狗 #广东虐狗 #动物\n\nEnglish version:\nPlease remember these four individuals.\nOn June 28, 2026, a horrifying and heartbreaking animal abuse incident reportedly took place in Pingpu Village, Xinhen Town, Jiedong District, Jieyang, Guangdong, China.\n\nFour sixth-grade students from Class 2 at Pingpu Primary School — Zhong Zishuo, Zhong Yuxuan, Zhong Sixin, and Zhong Xisheng — allegedly attacked a stray mother dog that was nursing her three half-month-old puppies.\n\nThey first used wire to restrain the mother dog by the neck and dragged her along the street. They then repeatedly beat and stabbed her with wooden sticks. The three helpless puppies were beaten to death on the spot. The mother dog refused to flee in order to protect her babies, but she was subjected to even more brutal abuse.\n\nThe children allegedly poured gasoline on the mother dog, set her on fire at the scene, and continued beating her as she struggled in pain. She eventually died from severe burns.\n\nThey were reportedly laughing while recording the incident and later uploaded the video online to boast about their actions.\n\n⚠️Warning: This video contains graphic animal abuse and disturbing content. Viewer discretion is advised."
